  designation: Former Oil Tycoon
  backstory: Used to high-stakes boardrooms and corporate wealth, Vance salvaged
    his company's private reserves when the collapse began. Dressed sharply despite
    the grime, he treats the apocalypse like a hostile takeover market, leveraging
    his precious fuel to buy safe passage and maintain control.
